  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">"Your app is a great platform for entertainment, but please promote Hindi globally, bring devotional serials like Radha-Krishna, and recruit fresh, talented actors. Replace outdated staff for better service. Open a film center in Aurangabad, Bihar, and add more Hindi &amp; Bhojpuri content. Show Indian TV shows ad-free. Invest in AI, establish an R&amp;D lab in Aurangabad, and offer WFH options with AI-powered solutions for efficient tasks. Expand services to Aurangabad Bihar 824101 soon! 🙏"</seon:commentText>
