  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 6eb1580f-6965-40b2-8f75-fb54ed63b559__job13__row108</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">You can't simply remove all you have watched before and those you simply don't ever want to see. You can't even filter out spoken languages you never wan't to try. There is no link to imdb to see if you've seen it or to see the better imdb score. The audio on the Netflix app on a new LG smart TV is off sync. So, the interface sucks hugely!</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

