  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 9f67bd8b-1a81-41a1-8290-6c385dfeade9__job13__row113</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I'm totally disappointed 😞 with this app of late. Despite paying for my membership card for more than 8 months now, I'm still experiencing trouble shooting challenges every time I want to watch a movie or a tv show. My account has been freezing for several months. I even called their customer care, but still, my issue hasn't been solved yet. Very disappointed 😞 😔. This has to change 😕.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

