  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Contant "Netflix is not responding" notifications interrupting. How did you screw up the app this time?!? And, yes, it's up to date. Your error, not mine! 3 days later, another update, same errors still popping up. Used to be a decent app. Now it's a mess.</seon:commentText>
