  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix offers a huge variety of movies and series with amazing streaming quality. The original shows are top-notch. The user interface is smooth and personalized. Perfect for binge-watching weekends.</seon:commentText>
