  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix is a great streaming app with a huge collection of movies, web series, and Netflix Originals. The video quality is excellent, and the app is easy to use. It’s perfect for binge-watching, but the subscription price feels a little high. Overall, a very good entertainment platform.</seon:commentText>
