  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 18c0ce9b-597f-4446-949d-d4f6121becc1__job13__row190</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix does provide the best series and movies , however they also provide you a worst experience every time if you want to purchase a membership . I have been trying for so long to start my membership again and every time they told me "there's a problem please try again later" I have enough money for a subscription. I have also tried different cards . They also don't provide customer support services in Pakistan.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

