  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 3c933a69-6efa-4059-ac88-ac41eebd260b__job13__row253</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I love using Netflix, but I miss seeing language details before playing a title. Please list available audio/subtitles on the info page so users can check for their preferred languages in advance. Also, a dedicated 'Serial Killers' category would be a great addition to the genres. Keep up the good work! ❤️</seon:commentText>
