  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">5 star for this app! The movies and shows are very good and has a high resolution. I just requested a refund earlier and talked to a live agent because my GCash accidentally paid a subscription without me knowing. The agents I talked to are very friendly and professional, I received a refund immediately! +999 aura for those 2 agents I talked to! (Ealina and Archit) W Netflix and their agents!</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

