  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In my opinion, great app and it has shows in different languages and different genres from around the world for a small fee. The video and sound quality of the movie is as good as watching the movie in the cinema for the first time . The user face is very simple and you can browse your favourite TC shows and Movies anytime.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

