  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">this app is very good for watching movies. it comes out with a lot of movies from South Korea, Japan, China, Indonesia and all across the world. not to mention, the movies are also in high quality so the viewers don't have to worry about the quality of the movies. they also include a short synopsis for the viewers to understand the storyline of the movies.</seon:commentText>
