  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the price is right for the content, Netflix has a pretty good selection, I wish there was an option to download shows they used to have like Buffy and the 100. I really miss rewatching my comfort shows and Netflix is the best place to watch without hassle, like so serious. please bring back Buffy. allot of millennials rewatch that show, you're missing out on the we who specifically got Netflix TO watch Buffy. Netflix is top, honestly. I'd never not, yk?</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

