  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Worst than the apps that are made by small companies. This is the worst possible app I've ever used. I gave my credit details 100% accurate, everything smooth and authentic and I had the budget to buy any subscription. Here I ma totally disappointed. It says Unable, try again later. In this later later game, 4 months have passed and it still says try again later. It's not my problem. I've seen and talked to many people who are facing the same problem. Billion dollar company with Brainrot</seon:commentText>
