  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 8843de54-cd54-49a9-a245-983504c2ccfe__job13__row483</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I love using Netflix for all my entertainment needs. The user interface is intuitive, which makes browsing and finding new shows quick and effortless. The video quality is excellent, even on slower connections, and the offline download feature is perfect for watching on the go. Netflix’s investment in original content has delivered so many favorites that I can’t find anywhere else. It’s become my go‑to platform for binge‑watching.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

