  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Sometimes movies aren't removed from continue watching section even after I finish watching them. No matter how many times I finish watching the credits, it just won't remove itself. I have to manually remove it. please fix this.</seon:commentText>
