  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The apps are actively trying to discourage you from using them on all devices, just pay. Terrible algorithms that usually don't keep track what you watched, how far were you when you watched it, pushing shows that you will never going to watch.</seon:commentText>
