  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Apparently Netflix thought it was a good idea to take away casting support? because needlessly limiting how the user can interact with their service will obviously encourage people to use it and not, idk immediately cancel their subscription. Sickening business practice at best, just plain stupid at worst.</seon:commentText>
