  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix is the ultimate comfort watch for when I’m finally off the study grind. The way the "Because you watched" section already knows my horror obsession is elite,it’s like it’s scouting for the next jump scare just for me. The offline downloads are a total flex for long commutes or when campus Wi-Fi decides to ghost, and the 4K quality is giving high-key cinematic energy.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

