  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Every time I play something I've downloaded, it severely stutters during payback. This gets very, very annoying as it happens basically almost every 2 seconds. I've tried clearing the cache, clearing the app data and reinstalling the app. Nothing fixed it. Maybe I'm just writing this out of rage but it happens every time so I feel like this needs to be fixed.</seon:commentText>
