  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Hey, Netflix please put seasons 7 &amp; 8 of The Rookie on Netflix. And I love this app it's perfect for watching movies with friends and family.</seon:commentText>
