  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 4252eb97-c209-45a9-acb2-ab9410630a4c__job13__row597</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">update: To the team that prioritized the household verification fix - THANK YOU! Frustrating and mediocre. The household verification is a nightmare; I have to sign in every single time at home and at my chalet. It never remembers me. To make matters worse, the algorithm is the worst kind of echo chamber and the content library feels second class. The experience is more of a chore than entertainment.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

