  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Remember when you could watch all the good stuff on Netflix for about eight or $9 now they want you to pay $17 to go to watch certain movies. I'm done I just deleted it and I'm never coming back.</seon:commentText>
