  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I can't browse around and see what movies, series, and anime are available; I keep getting a "PAY TO RENEW YOUR MEMBERSHIP" message. What kind of nonsense is this? Why would I renew my membership if I can't see or find out what's on it? So, I'm at ease.</seon:commentText>
