  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Why Screentouch Speed feature Stopped. Giving daily updates for app means you are not able to control quality of releases. Work on it and then share periodic updates instead of daily updates.</seon:commentText>
