  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The mobile app has almost become unusable, for some reason it mixes profile settings in terms of watch history and parental settings. Just bizzare for a company of this size. The quality of new content has decreased drastically over the past couple of years also. it's search functionality is wors than any other app I use. Shame.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

