  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When i want to log in to my acount i can't, it keeps taking me to the sign up page, i have an acount, when i want to sign in on the app, i put in my e-mail, it sends an e-mail with a link to sign up, when i already have an acount, it redirects me to my browser, i sign up again with the same e-mail, then i'm logged in without a password, but i'm only connected to my browser and not the app, why do i download the app only to get redirected to the browser, only to stay connected on the browser.</seon:commentText>
