  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I can sign in on my pc just fine but when I try to do so on my phone connected to the same wifi it won't let me it tries to get me to make a new account. The help page on their website is no help with this as it is poorly laid out. If this is how netflix does things now I will be canceling my subscription after I finish the show I wanted to watch and I won't be coming back.</seon:commentText>
