  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">update: app randomly kicks me out. requires my wife's email to verify. what a joke. ever think this kind of dependency was a bad idea? bc it is. App stopped working after upgrading to Android 11 on Pixel 2. Just displays message "Sorry we could not reach the Netflix service. Please try again later. (-1001)". Been like this for a few days. Reinstall did not work. Customer service seemed confused by error.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
