  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the new "household internet" update is stupid, I'm connected to my home WiFi and it won't let me watch Netflix, and its not like I can send a code to my email for a temporary watch since I lost my email which also means I can't cancel my subscription. fix your app</seon:commentText>
