  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Costs too much &amp; gatekeeps who is "part of the household." If I pay for a service, it's none of the business's business with whom I share it.And the content is not even quality. Mediocre companies continue to get more greedy; rapidly pumping out subpar content for a premium price.</seon:commentText>
