  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">When traveling abroad, some downloaded movies become unavailable in new country. I think if I pay for service in tbe US, I should be able to watch all the movies which are available in the US. Also, the is no download option for Windows, so I can't download movies to watch on tbe plane from windows tablet or laptop. Lastly, the prices went up quite significantly.</seon:commentText>
