  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 898bb679-de07-4a3b-9357-d8cdce77857c__job13__row679</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ALL download options have disappeared, why? yes i tried everything and again after i contacted netflix humans.. cleared cache, cleared data, restarted phone, signed out/signed in, obviously updated the app, etc etc - still no download for any movie or series. that was working well for years, till last night.. ok so now fixed, next day</seon:commentText>
