  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 759d4da2-1ec0-4126-a370-e1d427860655__job13__row690</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix is a great app for watching movies and series anytime. I like the wide variety of shows and how it recommends things based on what I watch. The streaming quality is good, but sometimes new content takes a while to appear. Overall, it’s perfect for relaxing and entertainment.</seon:commentText>
