  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">install it and it was good for a few days but recently when I watch my downloads offline the app just been kicking me out sometimes for no reason, I would try to go back it but it would keep on kicking me out, what's even the point of being able to download content but then not being able to watch them offline? Disappointing</seon:commentText>
