  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 8b28de33-81fa-4842-84db-7d2da586fba9__job13__row840</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I really like this app. But as a Bangladeshi it's almost impossible to buy a subscription because in Bangladesh there are no local payment method (like Bkash, Nagad, Rocket, Upay etc.). Also subscriptions aren't available in Bangladeshi Taka. So as a Bangladeshi you can't just buy a subscription. There is also an other issue and that is you can't find here any Bengali dubbed anime. This is disgusting.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

