  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">New "household" policy is infuriating and pointlessly blocks my of a service I pay for. How many times do I have to add the *same* devices everytime I use them?!? Hope the EU comes after Netflix and puts them to heel.</seon:commentText>
