  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">I told myself, “One episode only.” That was at 10PM. Suddenly it’s 3AM and I’m emotionally attached to fictional characters. The recommendations are too good. Every time I finish a show, Netflix already knows what to feed me next. Sleep? Optional.</seon:commentText>
