  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Netflix is an outstanding entertainment platform with a huge variety of movies, series, and documentaries. I enjoy high-quality streaming, personalized recommendations, and binge-watching anytime. It’s perfect for relaxing, discovering new stories, and enjoying great content alone or with family and friends.</seon:commentText>
