  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 61642abd-b344-4c0c-851d-b8b402af8637__job13__row916</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">3 stars because I love Netflix but.. Why are there SO MANY limited and unfinished series on netflix? It is like every second show I choose is unfinished or limited, and it sucks. You can't get invested in 6 episodes, or you can, but you won't get an ending, just cut off and left wondering. I really hope you guys will put out some longer and more complete tv series. Amazon Prime has more to offer for TV shows lately. Also, the price increases are getting crazy</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

