  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Not every episode of a show I watch plays but then I skip an episode an that one will play, I have update the app and cleaned out my cache I even uninstalled the app an tried again, so sick of the spinning and not being able to enjoy my money spent which I must say is quiet expensive then the rest of the show apps I pay for</seon:commentText>
