  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">​Best-in-Class Technology: Netflix’s app is still the gold standard. Whether you are on a flight with patchy Wi-Fi or a 4K home theater, their adaptive bitrate technology virtually eliminates buffering. ​Massive Original Library: From global hits like Stranger Things and Squid Game to new favorites like KPop Demon Hunters, no one produces more original content. ​</seon:commentText>
