  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Feedback 674f78a7-cde4-42f5-a07e-5b19ff56f629__job13__row982</rdfs:label>
  <seon:commentText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Such a money grab now. Used to be a good app, and experience. But it's turned to something not worth the subscription. Rarely do we find anything good. Personaliation is rubbish. Stop pushing the live sport events, I am not, and will never be interested. The layout currently is inconvenient since we have to scroll all the way up to search anything. Who even plays the games on it? You're a streaming service, so be a streaming service worth subscribing to.</seon:commentText>
  <seon:isProcessed rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</seon:isProcessed>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

